WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
It sorts tens of thousands of papers by claim.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
Deploy more agents. Read them all.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
This claim, which paper backs it?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.667
Sources? Just trust me, dear.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.333
The source box is empty.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.000
Uh, I, I rounded it up.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A source stamp on every claim.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
No source, it leaves the report.

